$$

So we compute:

$$
\text{LHS} = (A \cdot 36 + B \cdot 6 + C) + (B \cdot 36 + C \cdot 6 + A) + (C \cdot 36 + A \cdot 6 + B)
$$

Group and simplify:

Group the coefficients of $ A, B, C $:

$$
\text{LHS} = (A \cdot 36 + A \cdot 6 + A \cdot 1) + (B \cdot 6 + B \cdot 36 + B \cdot 1) + (C \cdot 6 + C \cdot 36 + C \cdot 1)
$$

$$
\text{LHS} = A(36 + 6 + 1) + B(6 + 36 + 1) + C(6 + 36 + 1)
$$

$$
